<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:43:07 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>用 Unreal Engine 把 Anyma 的 Coachella 演出扩展为广播 AR</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine</link><description>Anyma 的 Coachella 现场借助 Unreal Engine、MetaHuman 与广播 AR 技术，把音乐视觉体验带给了线上观众。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">337da5318251a6bfe1b582440f1fa57277a240c1</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>用 UE5 还原《Bluey》标志性 2D 画风：Gameloft Brisbane 的开发访谈</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/developer-interviews/say-cheese-recreating-an-iconic-2d-art-style-with-ue5-in-blueys-happy-snaps</link><description>Gameloft Brisbane 团队分享如何用 Unreal Engine 5 的动画工具，把热门儿童动画《Bluey》的 2D 世界搬进 3D 游戏。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b5f0043cd5b8425b97593ce35c3a133329a61b70</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/developer-interviews/say-cheese-recreating-an-iconic-2d-art-style-with-ue5-in-blueys-happy-snaps">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>Unity CLI 1.0 正式发布！</title><link>https://unity.com/the-unity-cli-1.0-is-here</link><description>Unity 命令行工具走出测试版，开发者可把 Claude Code 等 AI 编程助手接进 Unity 项目，在终端里自动跑构建和测试。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c31d0d34a17ff92ab6443e4ceed4062fe025d009</guid><source url="https://unity.com/the-unity-cli-1.0-is-here">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>泄露《GTA 6》的黑客承认入侵 Rockstar Games</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/hacker-behind-gta-6-leak-pleads-guilty-to-rockstar-games-breach</link><description>Lapsus$ 成员此前被裁定不适合受审，如今承认了导致《GTA 6》早期画面与源代码外泄的那次入侵。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:43:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1c396a1e76a3b52414b81c7ab08797785676fe23</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/hacker-behind-gta-6-leak-pleads-guilty-to-rockstar-games-breach">80 Level</source></item><item><title>探索音频驱动的面部表演，让 NPC 长对话更生动</title><link>https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298677-exploring-audio-driven-facial-performance-for-longer-npc-dialogue</link><description>长对话带来两个制作难题：如何生成可信的面部表演、又如何让表演在整场戏里保持一致，本文探讨用音频驱动的方案来解决。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:31:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5b5cd8a0689dbe288e4d61c0012a82c51c5906eb</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298677-exploring-audio-driven-facial-performance-for-longer-npc-dialogue">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>开源图像工作台 TexForge 发布：为游戏美术与批量处理而生</title><link>https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/texforge-is-out-a-open-source-image-workbench-for-games-and-batch-work-3e66</link><description>一款 MIT 协议的跨平台桌面工具，把法线贴图、通道打包、Mipmap 链与批量处理等 113 个图像操作收进一个工作台，覆盖 Unity、Unreal、Godot 等引擎的美术管线。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:16:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e92695680c30baac1334940ad3057439da383600</guid><source url="https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/texforge-is-out-a-open-source-image-workbench-for-games-and-batch-work-3e66">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>你的精灵图集校验器可能在查 JSON 解析器已经改过的数据</title><link>https://dev.to/framesprite-team/your-sprite-atlas-validator-may-be-checking-data-the-json-parser-already-changed-32om</link><description>图集 PNG 和元数据都能正常打开解析，不代表交付无歧义，问题藏在 JSON 原文与校验器拿到的数据之间。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:05:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cc369f4da507a4a8f9234f62c9dd991e4e3b589a</guid><source url="https://dev.to/framesprite-team/your-sprite-atlas-validator-may-be-checking-data-the-json-parser-already-changed-32om">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>报告：韩国手游下载量跌 28%，收入仍接近 50 亿美元</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/report-south-koreas-mobile-game-downloads-fall-28-as-revenue-holds-near-5bn</link><description>Sensor Tower 新报告显示韩国手游下载量五年间从 5.4 亿跌至 3.9 亿，但内购收入依然坚挺，手游市场正从拼下载转向拼留存与付费。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:27:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0cc00c4fd56d1c2effae902cdb52c29e6b7870ba</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/report-south-koreas-mobile-game-downloads-fall-28-as-revenue-holds-near-5bn">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>用这套优化工具包让 Unreal Engine 5 项目保持干净</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit</link><description>Leartes Studios 的编辑器扩展能给项目健康度打分、找出闲置资产并梳理依赖关系，帮 UE5 开发者把项目里的杂物清出去。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3ce9d8e2ac71fd8d4ee2e710010b525e54322835</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit">80 Level</source></item><item><title>《足球经理》熬了两年，总算重归正轨</title><link>https://www.yystv.cn/p/14634</link><description>从换 Unity 引擎导致跳票、FM25 被取消，到 FM26 重整旗鼓，对话 FM27 开发团队，聊聊这款年货系列如何走出低谷。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b42e79d62c6737f2c531831d995dcd5d487e37d8</guid><source url="https://www.yystv.cn/p/14634">游研社</source></item><item><title>PixiJS 进军 3D：PixiJS 3D 发布</title><link>https://gamefromscratch.com/pixijs-moves-into-3d-pixijs-3d</link><description>流行 2D WebGL/WebGPU 框架 PixiJS 正式支持 3D，GDevelop、RPG Maker 等引擎的开发者都能用上。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:06:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">77b6601917303d80cf45798531deaa0353bd8582</guid><source url="https://gamefromscratch.com/pixijs-moves-into-3d-pixijs-3d">GameFromScratch</source></item><item><title>招募：为一款 Unreal 引擎动作 Roguelite 找小型开发团队</title><link>https://gamedev.net/forums/topic/720850-no-ai-looking-for-a-small-team-to-help-develop-an-existing-unreal-engine-game</link><description>一位独立开发者为自己做了约一年的 Unreal 引擎第三人称动作 Roguelite 招募小型团队，希望把项目推向下一阶段。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:52:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">50f59f992d2df66f73a8051e66722fba87d6e745</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/forums/topic/720850-no-ai-looking-for-a-small-team-to-help-develop-an-existing-unreal-engine-game">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>《怪物猎人 Outlanders》两周内购收入突破 1020 万美元</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/monster-hunter-outlanders-passes-102-million-in-iap-revenue-in-two-weeks</link><description>怪物猎人手游上线两周多内购收入破千万美元，这份变现成绩单能给独立开发者做手游商业化时当个参照。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:05:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">64ae5e03299a3b37ef515a2558dbbaeb9681f407</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/monster-hunter-outlanders-passes-102-million-in-iap-revenue-in-two-weeks">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item><item><title>用 AI 做游戏：从一句话创意到手机上可玩</title><link>https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-make-a-game-with-ai-from-the-idea-to-your-phone-4n0e</link><description>一句话描述创意、审 AI 写的开发计划、在手机上试玩，再用自然语言让 AI 改——这篇指南以 Tyrbo 引擎为例，手把手带新手走完 AI 做游戏的完整流程，并点出新手最容易踩的坑。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:44:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">90703adb2699a62e010d16f742c7ad1be3a05fbe</guid><source url="https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-make-a-game-with-ai-from-the-idea-to-your-phone-4n0e">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Sensor Tower：GTA 6 预购额超 14 亿美元，87% 来自终极版</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-gta-6-pre-orders-exceed-14bn-with-87-for-the-ultimate-edition</link><description>预购数据透露了玩家对高价版本的接受度，值得关注 3A 大作的定价策略与版本分层。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">834fa9ad8d3bea420b598799b0d706ddfa44e302</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-gta-6-pre-orders-exceed-14bn-with-87-for-the-ultimate-edition">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item><item><title>62 款微型浏览器游戏还在涨：Pop Recall 的每日发版日志</title><link>https://dev.to/poprecallgames/62-tiny-browser-games-and-counting-pop-recalls-daily-shipping-log-223</link><description>Pop Recall 四天前以 25 款纯原生 JavaScript 微型浏览器游戏上线，如今已涨到 62 款仍在每日更新；每款新游戏都要过同一套发版关卡——能通关、适配手机、暂停真正锁输入，上线后还要实测。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:02:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bb9bea4dc38062e2a06ca03a97e91d08a3a23e97</guid><source url="https://dev.to/poprecallgames/62-tiny-browser-games-and-counting-pop-recalls-daily-shipping-log-223">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 HTML5 Canvas 与 WebSockets 打造实时多人棋盘游戏引擎：Ludo Classic 架构解析</title><link>https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4</link><description>作者拆解一款实时多人棋盘游戏的引擎架构，讲 Canvas 渲染与 WebSocket 同步如何支撑回合制对局。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:36:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">88e75b91ad9b7b716d17c88b0da6dd320118eb68</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了一个 AI 助手，能用一句话聊天指令改 Unreal Engine 蓝图</title><link>https://dev.to/dola_ai_pro/i-built-an-ai-agent-that-edits-unreal-engine-blueprints-from-a-chat-prompt-3d4d</link><description>独立开发者花一年做的 Dola AI 嵌进 UE5 编辑器里，用自然语言描述需求就能让多智能体改蓝图、写 C++ 并自动试玩验证，文章讲了它怎么工作、还差在哪。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 04:33:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5a368a99abb674e259c4b4bc19b38e53f1d02ea5</guid><source url="https://dev.to/dola_ai_pro/i-built-an-ai-agent-that-edits-unreal-engine-blueprints-from-a-chat-prompt-3d4d">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>独游开发者吐槽：“发行商想要55%收入，还不保证营销费” ，同行：来收租呢？</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606580</link><description>五名芬兰学生开发的弹球 Roguelike 收到的首份发行报价要拿走 55% 收入且不保证营销投入，引发同行对发行分成是否合理的讨论。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:07:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">42e79b06e54b907242eccd909cd5629c2eb2bd69</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606580">GameLook</source></item><item><title>Newzoo：GTA 6 预购者多为典型主机玩家且以男性为主，游戏将“扩大市场而非简单再分配”</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/newzoo-gta-6-pre-orders-are-archetypal-console-players-but-overwhelmingly-male-game-will-grow-the-market-rather-than-simply-redistribute-it</link><description>Newzoo 的数据显示，GTA 6 预购者多是高消费的典型主机玩家且以男性为主，这款游戏更可能把整个市场做大，而非只在现有玩家之间重新分配。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6df1c951d5f0d9f46be95b1cbd34404f05a8cd5e</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/newzoo-gta-6-pre-orders-are-archetypal-console-players-but-overwhelmingly-male-game-will-grow-the-market-rather-than-simply-redistribute-it">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item></channel></rss>
